I am in the small vegetable shop.
There are many vegetables there.
I suddenly see a new vegetable.
It is very long.
It has a pale green color.
It has white stripes on it.
I do not know that vegetable.
I look at the shopkeeper.
"What is this?" I ask him.
He smiles.
"This is padavalanga," he says.
"Padavalanga," I say softly.
I like new vegetables.
"I want this," I say.
I take a snake gourd.
I give it to him.
